Egern IP Quality Widget

The Egern integration, configuration, widget rendering and tests in this
repository were written for YUDIDIFEI in 2026.

Media endpoint selection and detection ideas are adapted from:
  MaYIHEI/paperclip — loon/ipquality/ipquality.js
  https://github.com/MaYIHEI/paperclip
  Reviewed commit: eaa04fe0a9f37ccfafdd11930d28fd5ff3f04718

The original script credits:
  Roddy-D — https://github.com/Roddy-D/Loon_plugins
  xykt — https://github.com/xykt/IPQuality

No upstream runtime is downloaded or executed by this widget. No upstream
embedded client token or complete HTML report is included. This is a native
Egern rewrite with a deliberately smaller feature set.

